OL,3,GNEWSASurgery could give seal chance to
OL,4,Aexperience sight
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fundraising appeal has been launched
OL,7,Fto give a seal the "chance to see the
OL,8,Fworld around him" for the first time.
OL,10,FThe Cornish Seal Sanctuary in Gweek,
OL,11,FCornwall, said it needed to raise
OL,12,F#15,600 for a proposed surgery for its
OL,13,Fresident seal Jarvis, who was rescued
OL,14,Fin 2016 with cataracts in both eyes.
OL,16,F"He is such a special character and has
OL,17,Fan incredible ability to adapt to the
OL,18,Fworld around him. Everyone who meets
OL,19,FJarvis falls in love with him," said
OL,20,FClare Addyman, the seal's primary
OL,21,Fcarer.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
